# Falling platform (plain skin), native 32x10 frames: the striped slab over its spinning fan (fan1..fan4).
# The slab is the same in every frame; #362 (D71 at-rest cue): a hairline crack through it at x 22-23, slanting
# against the stripes, with a 1 px gap in the top and bottom edge where it breaks through.
size 32 10
color k 211f30
# c: the crack, the same ink as k; its own char so the moon rim (D92) never repaints it (forest_trap_sprites.RIM_KEEP).
color c 211f30
color s 48475b
color y f7ec8a
color g 858d99
color Y e1ca33
color h 62677a
color m afbbc3
color w d8e1e4
